---
import { links } from '../data/links';
---

<aside class="support-panel" aria-labelledby="support-panel-title">
	<div>
		<p class="eyebrow">If you’d like to help</p>
		<h2 id="support-panel-title">Support, without the pressure</h2>
		<p>Much of Samly is free, including some pay-what-you-want games. The best support is always something that feels worthwhile to you.</p>
	</div>
	<ol class="support-steps">
		<li><span>1</span><div><strong>Choose something you want</strong><p>Buy a game or some music you’ll genuinely enjoy.</p></div></li>
		<li><span>2</span><div><strong>Subscribe when it suits you</strong><p>A Twitch subscription can help when you’re already watching.</p></div></li>
		<li><span>3</span><div><strong>Donate only if you freely wish</strong><p>Ko-fi is an optional way to help keep the project going.</p></div></li>
	</ol>
	<div class="button-row">
		<a class="button button-primary" href="/support">Read about support</a>
		<a class="button button-quiet" href={links.kofi}>Visit Ko-fi <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
	</div>
</aside>
